    "content": "Goal\n* Please change \"Cells\" to \"Positions\".\n\nInput\n* Please change \"<>\" to \"<<Next line:>>\".\n\n* Please change \"Two integers\" to \"Two space-separated integers\" (for both Line 1 and the last line).\n\nConstraints\n* Please change 100 to 10.\n\nCases\n* Please add Test 5 and Validator 5 where:\n  • [[H]] > [[W]] > 3\n  • [[R]] > [[C]], and\n  • all grid values are random negative 2-digit integers.\n\n* Please add Test 6 and Validator 6 where:\n  • [[H]] > [[W]] > 4\n  • [[C]] = [[W]] - 1, and\n  • all grid values are random negative 3-digit integers.\n\n* Please add Test 7 and Validator 7 where:\n  • (the order is different) [[W]] > [[H]] > 5\n  • [[R]] = [[H]] - 1, and\n  • all grid values are random positive 3-digit integers.\n\n* Please add Test 8 and Validator 8 where:\n  • [[W]] = [[H]] = 10\n  • [[C]] > [[R]] > 0, and\n  • all grid values are random integers from the entire range between -1000 and 1000.\n\nThanks.",
